---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Experiments from seanslab
description: Deep-dive essays about invisible infrastructure, engineering, and the systems beneath everyday technology.
permalink: /
---
<section class="hero shell">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Independent engineering notes · Singapore</p>
    <h1>The infrastructure is invisible.<br><em>The consequences aren't.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-intro">Long-form stories about codecs, protocols, hardware, AI, and the people who made modern technology feel ordinary.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/posts/">Read the writing <span>→</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>EXPERIMENT<br>NO. 001</span>
    <img src="/assets/mark-starchart.svg" alt="">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="featured shell" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Selected writing</p>
      <h2 id="featured-title">Start here</h2>
    </div>
    <a href="/posts/">View all {{ collections.posts.length }} essays</a>
  </div>
  <div class="story-grid">
    {% for post in collections.featuredPosts %}
      <article class="story-card{% if loop.index == 1 %} story-card--lead{% endif %}">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" aria-label="Read {{ post.data.title }}">
          <div class="story-index">
            <span>0{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <span>{{ post.data.series or "Field notes" }}</span>
          </div>
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          <div class="story-footer">
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | dateDisplay }}</time>
            <span>{{ post.content | readingTime }} min →</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="manifesto shell">
  <p class="manifesto-number">39 <span>bits / second</span></p>
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">A working belief</p>
    <blockquote>Technology becomes interesting when you follow a constraint all the way down—and find a person at the bottom.</blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="latest shell" aria-labelledby="latest-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">From the notebook</p>
      <h2 id="latest-title">Latest essays</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ol class="story-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if loop.index <= 5 %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | dateDisplay }}</time>
          <span>{{ post.data.title }}</span>
          <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
